  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for Hateoas: one LinkProvider per resource type applied automatically to every endpoint response by an endpoint filter (items, lists, pages, nested), route-name based hrefs that fail loudly when unresolvable, state- and permission-aware conditional links, CURIE-prefixed extension relations, Location on 201 Created and RFC 8288 Link headers on paged collections.",
